# Warn intent color (LOCKED)

Warn / warning uses the Button Standard intent lock in
`src/Products/PinoyBusinessPOS/ExItS.PinoyBusinessPOS.React/src/features/ui-standards/intent-color-global-default.ts`.

- Locked fill: `INTENT_GLOBAL_WARN` = `#ff5722`
- Token: `--exits-warning` (and `--exits-severity-warn` in light)
- Amber (`INTENT_GLOBAL_AMBER` / `#ffc107`) is a separate intent
- **Never** use brown (`#92400e`, `#b45309`, `#b54708`, `#ca8a04`, and kin) for warn

Product UI that needs warn should use `var(--exits-warning)` or `INTENT_GLOBAL_WARN`, not a freehand amber/brown hex.
